d runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 231% of normal in March to April and just 44% in November to December. January to February is the driest pair at 3.46 inches of normal and May to June the wettest at 9.70 inches. Grid 17231 had its driest year in 1963 at 51%.</p>"}
